  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institute for youth development, KULT</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Institutet f&#xf6;r ungdomsutveckling, KULT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ungdomsorganisationer har en nyckelroll n&#xe4;r det g&#xe4;ller att uttrycka och formulera ungdomars prioriteringar, behov och intressen. Insatsen syftar till att st&#xe4;rka ungdomar och ungdomsledare f&#xf6;r en mer inkluderande demokratisk process.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth CSOs play a key role in voicing youth priorites, needs and interests. The contribution aims at empowering youth and youth leaders for a more inclusive democratic process</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Project the Institute for Youth Development KULT is implementing the following components:
1. Empowering local youth CSOs through sub-granting
2. Training program Learn Think and Act! (UMiD)
3.The Academy for Youth Political Leaders
4.Training program for Youth Officers
5.Public advocacy campaigns
6. Supporting youth entrepreneurship through sub-granting
7. Promotional and visibility activities
These components (under which groups of activities are implemented) are a level below the 3 &quot;outcome&quot; levels or pillars including the following:
1. Improved conditions for democratic accountability to young people and their participation in civic and political processes, including the promotion of free elections.
2. Young women and young men have, to a greater extent, the same power to shape society and their own lives.
3. Increased trust and reconciliation among young people in all parts of BiH.</narrative>
  </description>
